{
  "$schema": "../node_modules/@stryker-mutator/core/schema/stryker-schema.json",
  "mutate": [
    "packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/pipeline/**/*.ts",
    "packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/catalog/**/*.ts",
    "packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/shared/**/*.ts",
    "packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/upgrade/**/*.ts",
    "packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/shared/**/*.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/client/**",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/**/interface.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/*/deps.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/*/*/deps.ts"
  ],
  "testRunner": "vitest",
  "mutator": {
    "excludedMutations": [
      "StringLiteral",
      "ArrayLiteral",
      "ObjectLiteral",
      "TemplateLiteral"
    ]
  },
  "plugins": [
    "@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner"
  ],
  "concurrency": 16,
  "timeoutMS": 60000,
  "dryRunTimeoutMinutes": 5,
  "reporters": [
    "progress",
    "clear-text",
    "json"
  ],
  "coverageAnalysis": "perTest",
  "tempDirName": ".stryker-tmp",
  "cleanTempDir": true,
  "vitest": {
    "related": false,
    "configFile": "vitest.stryker.d/dsh-mcp-manager-runtime.config.ts"
  },
  "jsonReporter": {
    "fileName": "coverage/mutation/dsh-mcp-manager-runtime.json"
  },
  "incremental": true,
  "incrementalFile": "coverage/mutation/incremental-mcp-manager-runtime.json",
  "_comment": "#767 B2b 重画：runtime——packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/shared/placement-math.ts（#378 上移的 placement 纯核心，由本段 mutate 覆盖）+执行管道（pipeline）+目录（catalog）+包内共享层（server/shared）+迁移链（upgrade）+跨端共享面（src/shared）；B2b 后文件归各域段，本段只留这些。同时收敛 #767 B0 的临时超集 src/server/**/*.ts——当时目标树全新，不先挂超集会让 B1 新文件进 uncoveredSrcFiles 而 --write-baseline 拒绝接受新证据；各段并集现已覆盖它（本刀实测 uncoveredSrcFiles 仍为 0），故删除。W11b2a 删除 src/types 与 src/integration 后，原两条排除已成 0 命中死条目，随本刀删除；excludes 仅保留 client 一条（另一端）。测试按段 testFiles 清单跑（perTest 关联）；incremental 基线随 observe 夜间全量班重建（D7 迁移豁免）。"
}
